  "mosaicLayout": {
    "columns": 12,
    "tiles": [
      {
        "xPos": 0,
        "yPos": 0,
        "width": 12,
        "height": 3,
        "widget": {
          "title": "100% Native GCP AI Gateway FinOps, Team Chargeback & Multi-Harness Governance Console",
          "text": {
            "format": "MARKDOWN",
            "content": "### Apigee X + Vertex AI Model Garden Unified FinOps (`@GCP_PROJECT_ID@` — Zero Self-Hosted Databases)\n- **Org-Wide Totals by Default (Filterable)**: Scorecards show totals **across all developers & teams** when top filters are `*`, or scope down dynamically when you pick a `team_name`, `developer_email`, or `coding_harness`.\n- **Spend vs. Savings Explained Plainly**: **Vertex AI List Spend (`$`)** = public rate-card cost of routed calls · **Actual Billed Spend (`$ After Credits`)** = actual GCP invoice charge after **@GEMINI_POOL_SUMMARY@** (`$0` on Gemini) + **@GCP_FSP_DISCOUNT_PCT@% GCP FSP commit discount** · **Total Saved vs Unrouted Opus (`$`)** = money saved vs. sending every call to Claude Opus (`$15/$75`).\n- **Tip**: Keep **`Group by`** set to `None` in the top-left bar so per-Team, per-Developer, and per-Model tables display their own breakdown columns."
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "xPos": 0,
        "yPos": 3,
        "width": 2,
        "height": 3,
        "widget": {
          "title": "Vertex AI List Spend ($)",
          "scorecard": {
            "timeSeriesQuery": {
              "prometheusQuery": "sum(sum_over_time(logging_googleapis_com:user_ai_router_actual_cost_usd_sum{monitored_resource=\"global\"}[${__interval}]))",
              "unitOverride": "USD",
              "outputFullDuration": true
            },
            "blankView": {}
          }
        }
      },
